Changed file: internal/scrape/scrape.go

Intent:
feat(scrape): scraper etiquette — declarative rate limit, User-Agent, 401-relogin

ScraperSpec gains MinRequestIntervalMS (validated non-negative): the engine
spaces requests per scraper ID, honoring context cancellation while waiting,
and the login exchange waits its turn too. Every engine request now carries
the beamfall User-Agent (MusicBrainz etiquette; MinRequestIntervalMS: 1100
set on the MusicBrainz scraper). A 401 on a login-bearer spec invalidates
the cached token, re-logins once, and retries once — a second 401 surfaces.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

