Changed file: internal/web/static/app.js

Intent:
feat(web): route opened entities through manifest detail Layouts

The web Viewer now matches the Apple clients' entity routing: when the
manifest carries a Layout with role "detail" whose entityKind matches the
opened entity's kind, its Sections render through the same section path as
browse — sourceItems hydration with entityID riding the variables object
for entity-media Sources, the shared card renderer (media plays, entity
cards open), empty sections hidden. No matching Layout, or hydration
failure, falls back to the hand-rolled mediaForEntity list unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

